  "description": "As a Site Merchandiser, I want to manage the content of the Assistance, Shipping and Returns, and Secured Payments accordion sections in Contentful, so that I can update this information across storefronts without requiring a code deployment.\n\nThis story covers the Contentful content type definition and schema setup for the static informational accordion component. These accordion sections appear on the cart page order summary panel (desktop and mobile), as shown in the Figma designs. This is a reusable component likely used across multiple pages (PDP, checkout etc) but is confirmed in scope for the cart page. Content will vary per storefront and locale and must be authored by Zimmermann in Contentful before end-to-end testing can be completed.\n\nThe corresponding PWA Kit component story that fetches and renders this content on the cart page is covered by SFCC-287 in the Cart and Inventory epic.\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):**\n\n![\"image-20260803-050516.png\"](image-20260803-050516.png)",
