e epics (Cart, PDP, PLP etc); this epic covers the Contentful content type only\n\n**Dependencies**\n\n- Contentful environment provisioning and access must be in place before content type creation can begin\n- Zimmermann must author content per storefront and locale before PWA Kit components can be tested end-to-end\n- PWA Kit component stories in feature epics depend on Contentful content types existing first\n- Tim Lavelle (Solution Architect) — global Contentful fetch failure pattern and placeholders content model structure must be confirmed before stories are written\n\n**Assumptions & Constraints**\n\n- Contentful is the single CMS for all non-transactional content across the PWA storefront\n- Section title labels (e.g. accordion headers) are managed via the placeholders content model; body content is authored per storefront\n- Reusable content type structures are built once and referenced across multiple page surfaces; body content is authored separately per surface as content will differ\n- Content types are an Accenture deliverable; content authoring is a Zimmermann responsibility — to be confirmed with Tim Lavelle",
  "status": {
    "name": "To Do",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Epic"
  }
}"}

