  "key": "SFCC-306",
  "summary": "Contentful – Empty Cart State Text Component (Heading and Client Services Details)",
  "description": "As a Site Merchandiser, I want to manage the empty cart state content in Contentful, so that I can update Client Services contact details and supporting copy across storefronts without requiring a code deployment.\n\nThis story covers the Contentful content type definition and schema setup for the empty cart state text component. Content includes the empty cart heading (e.g. \"YOUR BAG IS EMPTY\"), Client Services phone number, operating hours, and email address. The heading will sit within the global placeholders content model; the Client Services details will be a simple text content type. Content varies per storefront and locale and must be authored by Zimmermann before end-to-end testing of SFCC-277 can be completed.\n\nThe corresponding PWA Kit component story that fetches and renders this content on the cart page is covered by SFCC-277 in the Cart and Inventory epic.\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):**\n\n![\"image-20260803-051145.png\"](image-20260803-051145.png)",
